ef.\n\n4. What is the nationality of the person who likes chess?\n   - The person who likes chess is in position 1, nationality canadian.\n\nSo the answers are:\ncanadian, 2, chef, canadian\n\n<solution>canadian, 2, chef, canadian</solution>\n\nFinal answer: <solution>canadian, 2, chef, canadian</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "Let", "logprob": -0.03867996111512184}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.0027549429796636105}, {"token": " analyze", "logprob": -0.2698116898536682}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.00012659224739763886}, {"token": " problem", "logprob": -1.014432668685913}, {"token": " step", "logprob": -0.00024327656137757003}, {"token": " by", "logprob": -0.003184131346642971}, {"token": " step", "logprob": -1.0728830375228426e-06}, {"token": ".\n\n", "logprob": -0.1782977432012558}, {"token": "We", "logprob": -1.0232267379760742}, {"token": " have", "logprob": -4.911301948595792e-05}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -1.1370282173156738}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -2.098061486321967e-05}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -0.0002585315378382802}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.27250829339027405}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.002671484835445881}, {"token": " line", "logprob": -6.198863957251888e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.22861389815807343}, {"token": " numbered", "logprob": -0.31644144654273987}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.13171608746051788}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -3.576272320060525e-06}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -0.22901436686515808}, {"token": "left", "logprob": -5.8412379075889476e-06}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -0.100218765437603}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.12692835927009583}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -1.311301275563892e-06}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -1.5497195136049413e-06}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -5.483612312673358e-06}, {"token": "right", "logprob": -1.311301275563892e-06}, {"token": ").", "logprob": -0.036387279629707336}, {"token": " Each", "logprob": -0.003413447644561529}, {"token": " person", "logprob": -0.575994610786438}, 